{"unit_id":"tag:03PU:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。集合（sets）的层（sheaves）之间的映射（map）<MATH_0002>是单射（injective）（相应地，<SPACE_0001>满射（surjective）），当且仅当茎（stalks）上的映射（map）\n<MATH_0003>\n是单射（injective）（相应地，<SPACE_0002>满射（surjective）），对于<MATH_0004>的所有几何点（geometric points）都是如此。<MATH_0005>上的阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）的序列（sequence）正合（exact），当且仅当它在所有茎（stalks）上都正合（exact），这里是在<MATH_0006>的所有几何点（geometric points）处。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"stalks","target_term":"茎","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"词表尚未批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:040S:statement","translation":"关于几何的景（sites）的点（points）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>定理<REF_0001>说明，<MATH_0001>的点（points）组成的族（family），由<MATH_0002>的几何点（geometric points）给出（引理<REF_0002>），是保守的（conservative），见景（Sites）定义<REF_0003>。特别地，<MATH_0003>有足够多的点（enough points）。\n<STRUCT_0003>设<MATH_0004>为大（big）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site）上的层（sheaf）\n<LOCKED_0001>\n，其定义于<MATH_0005>上。设<MATH_0006>为大（big）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）景（site）的对象（object），这里是对<MATH_0007>而言，设<MATH_0008>为<MATH_0009>的几何点（geometric point）。于是，我们将<MATH_0010>定义为限制（restriction）<MATH_0011>的茎（stalk），这里是将<MATH_0012>限于小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）景（site），它定义于<MATH_0013>上。换言之，我们可以定义<MATH_0014>在任意概形（scheme）<MATH_0015>的任意几何点（geometric point）处的茎（stalk）。\n<STRUCT_0004>大（big）平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）景（site），它属于<MATH_0016>，也有足够多的点（enough points），只需考虑这个景（site）的所有对象（objects）的所有几何点（geometric points），见（<REF_0004>）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"geometric points","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"conservative","target_term":"保守的"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"enough points","target_term":"足够多的点"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"stalk","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term